{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> the depths of the mountain, carve your own tunnels. Move at your own pace and listen to your instincts. Bring <strong>treasures</strong> to the surface and enhance your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mountain\u2019s belly is vast, dig wherever you please. If your intuition guides you well, you\u2019ll discover countless enigmatic <strong>chambers</strong>, <strong>corridors</strong>, and <strong>halls</strong> filled with riches. Once you\u2019ve gained enough experience and gold, you\u2019ll be able to purchase powerful tools. With these tools, you\u2019ll finally be able to solve the mountain\u2019s greatest secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now grab your <strong>pickaxe</strong> and head into the forgotten\u00a0<strong>CAVE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/DiggingGif1.gif?t=1744962412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628580?t=1744962412","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628580?t=1744962412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/2e82efe964d76d193acd7930414f4609c77fae34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744962412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/2e82efe964d76d193acd7930414f4609c77fae34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744962412","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"